                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really wanted to like this. The story was good, and I liked the humour, but I really dislike the combat system. \n\nI wish there was a way to auto-complete battles so I didn't have to tediously sit through them, or that the 'auto' function did more than just basic attacks, so I could just focus on the story. Especially when some of the bosses are extremely difficult. And there is no way to see your HP/MP during the fights - your characters become more bloodied as their HP depletes, but that's the only indicator you get. \n\nI also dislike the way that items are hidden everywhere, so you have to click on every single item in a room. I was using the mouse controls and they're a bit finicky.",
